---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { business, days } from '../data/site';

const title = 'About Grand Detailing | Stagsden Road, Bedford';
const description =
  'Grand Detailing is a car detailing service at 78 Stagsden Road, Bedford, MK43 8PU. Ollie and Luke are the names on the Google reviews.';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'About', path: '/about' }];
---

<Base title={title} description={description} path="/about" crumbs={crumbs}>
  <PageHero
    title="The people named on the reviews."
    lede="Grand Detailing is a car detailing service. The public Google listing has an address, a phone number, hours, two reviews, and seven photos. This page sticks to that."
    crumbs={crumbs}
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose" style="max-width: 44rem">
      <p>
        The address is {business.street}, {business.locality} {business.postcode}. That part of Stagsden Road is in Bromham. Bedford is the postal town. The plus code on the listing is {business.plusCode}.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google’s category on the listing is “{business.category}”. There is no website link and no email address on it. The phone number is {business.phoneDisplay}.
      </p>
      <p>
        Ryan Porte’s review names Ollie and Luke. They turned up on time and cleaned both of his vans to a high standard, in the rain. He then booked a regular clean.
      </p>
      <p>
        Ollie Neal wrote that his vehicle was detailed inside and out, and that the service and the result surprised him. The owner replied on Google in 2023: “Thanks for leaving a review we're glad you like the final results!” The reply is not signed with a name.
      </p>
      <p>
        Hours on the listing are {business.hoursLabel}, every day. Google also lists a wheelchair-accessible car park. If you need a certain space, say so when you call.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site does not add a year the business opened, a list of products, or a set of prices. None of those are on the listing. If you need a price, phone them.
      </p>
      <h2>Hours</h2>
      <table class="hours">
        <caption class="sr-only">Opening hours from the Google listing</caption>
        <tbody>
          {days.map((day) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">{day}</th>
              <td>{business.hoursLabel}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href={`tel:${business.phoneTel}`}>Call {business.phoneDisplay}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
